      "pins": ["R4.1", "R4.2"],
      "nets": ["Net-(J8-Pin_3)", "/PWM2"],
      "observed": "R4 is listed as value \"1\" in the netlist and is exported to the SPICE deck as a 1 Ω resistor between Net-(J8-Pin_3) and /PWM2.",
      "expected": "R4 should be 1 kΩ, matching R3 and the specification's 1 kΩ series resistor from /PWM2 to J8 pin 3.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(comp (ref \"R4\")\n      (value \"1\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "spice",
          "quote": "R4 Net-_J8-Pin_3_ /PWM2 1"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "R3, R4 | 1k each | Series resistors from the PWM1/PWM2 GPIO nets to J3 pin 3 / J8 pin 3 respectively."
        }
      ],
      "impact": "If populated, the PWM2 servo signal path has a 1 Ω series resistor instead of the intended 1 kΩ buffer, changing the signal current limiting and potentially loading or stressing the GPIO/servo signal input.",
      "confidence": 0.9
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The board connectivity otherwise matches the specification, but R4 is incorrectly specified as 1 Ω instead of the required 1 kΩ, which is a clear wrong-value anomaly."
}

